OL,3,GNEWSA'Stay happy': Girl's journey from
OL,4,Acancer ward to live TV
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn many ways, Blathnaid is a typical
OL,7,F12-year-old, who enjoys hanging around
OL,8,Fin the park with her friends, loves
OL,9,Fmusic and is learning to play the piano
OL,10,Fand guitar.
OL,12,FShe is animated, chatty, confident and
OL,13,Ffull of life, despite having just
OL,14,Fcompleted two and a half years of
OL,15,Fintensive chemotherapy and almost
OL,16,Flosing her life ` twice.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
