OL,3,GNEWSA'Stay happy': Girl's journey from
OL,4,Acancer ward to live TV
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlathnaid was diagnosed with T-cell
OL,7,Facute lymphoblastic leukaemia, an
OL,8,Faggressive blood cancer, aged nine. She
OL,9,Fhas been supported along a
OL,10,Flife-changing journey by the cancer
OL,11,Fcharity Pasic, which receives funding
OL,12,Ffrom Children in Need.
OL,14,FNow, she is preparing to take part in
OL,15,Fthe Children in Need choir on national
OL,16,Ftelevision.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
